---
import ContactIcon from "./ContactIcon.astro";
---
<section class="cs-hero cs-shell" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="cs-hero__copy">
    <p class="cs-kicker">Direct Human Response · Global Operations Desk</p>
    <h1 id="contact-title">Speak with the Chakusa Team. <span>Direct, grounded support</span> for local artisans and loyal clients.</h1>
    <div class="cs-hero__lede">Whether you run a bustling multi-chair shop, dispatch heavy mobile trade crews, or rely on effortless neighborhood appointments, our dedicated desks resolve inquiries with technical precision and artisanal respect.</div>
    <ul><li><ContactIcon name="timer" />&lt; 2h Response Avg.</li><li><ContactIcon name="bolt" />90s Dispatch Priority</li><li><ContactIcon name="shield" />Data Sovereignty Guaranteed</li></ul>
  </div>
  <figure class="cs-hero__visual"><img src="/images/contact/support-specialist.jpg" width="512" height="384" alt="Chakusa trade operations and customer care specialist" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption><span><ContactIcon name="support" /></span><div><strong>Artisan Care Desk</strong><small>Live operator coverage active · &lt; 2h SLA</small></div><b>MON - SAT</b></figcaption></figure>
</section>
